              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I kom nino dwe apar wiye abic me dwe me abiro, ka doŋ wucoko cam ma ocek i lobo, wubikwero nino madito pa Rwot pi nino abiro; nino mukwoŋo bibedo nino me yweyo mot, ki nino me aborone bene bibedo nino me yweyo mot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino mukwoŋo wubicoko iye nyig yat mabecone, ki jaŋ otit, ki jaŋ yat muluk, ki yat oget ma i ŋet kulu; ci wubibedo ki yomcwiny i nyim Rwot Lubaŋawu pi nino abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubikwero nino madito man pa Rwot pi nino abiro mwaka ki mwaka; meno bibedo cik matwal wa i kare pa likwayowu ducu; wubikwerone i dwe me abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubibedo i bolo pi nino abiro; litino anywalli ducu ma i Icrael bibedo i bolc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wek likwayowu guŋe ni, yam amiyo jo Icrael gubedo i bolo i kare ma akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt; an a Rwot Lubaŋawu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
